# Agency Website

## Goal
Create a premium digital agency landing page.

## Stack
- Vue 3 (Composition API, `<script setup>`)
- Vite
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS

## Main positioning
Build. Grow. Automate.

## Services
1. Software & Digital Solutions
2. AI & Automation
3. Digital Marketing
4. Content & Branding

## Design
- Premium, modern, minimal, technology-focused
- Mobile first — design for small screens, then scale up
- Generous whitespace, clear visual hierarchy
- Subtle motion/transitions welcome, avoid anything gimmicky

## Component conventions
- One component per file, PascalCase filenames (e.g. `HeroSection.vue`)
- Section-level components live in `src/components/sections`
- Reusable UI primitives (buttons, cards, etc.) live in `src/components/ui`
- Keep components small and composable — no giant monolithic page files

## Rules
- Mobile first
- Reusable components
- No unnecessary dependencies — check before adding a new package
- Don't modify unrelated components when working on a specific section
- Accessibility: semantic HTML, alt text on images, visible focus states, sufficient color contrast (WCAG AA)
- SEO: descriptive page title/meta description, semantic heading order (one h1 per page), alt text on images    